{"product":{"id":8542896849235,"title":"Lumin Skin Dark Circle Defense Balm","body_html":"\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDARK CIRCLE DEFENSE BALM BY LUMIN SKIN\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eA men's daily under eye cream for dark circles, fine lines, \u0026amp; wrinkles that is suitable for all skin types.\u003cbr\u003eLooks like you slept a solid eight hours(even when you didn't). Use daily to calm puffy eyes, target dark circles, and soften the look of fine lines.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBENEFITS:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"benefits-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative\"\u003eA lightweight gel texture that glides on and absorbs seamlessly\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative\"\u003eInstantly plumps dehydration lines\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative\"\u003eFights the appearance of crows feet and temporarily reduces the appearance of puffiness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"relative\"\u003eIt's basically an espresso shot for your eyes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePress the pump once for the perfect amount of under eye cream. Then, use your ring finger to lightly tap the product below your eye. Repeat on the other side.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"eye cream","created_at":"2023-09-24T20:37:33+03:00","handle":"lumin-skin-dark-circle-defense-balm","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:17+03:00","published_at":"2023-09-24T20:37:33+03:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"eye care, Fall Deals, lumin skin","variants":[{"id":47114962927955,"product_id":8542896849235,"title":"20ml","price":"32.95","sku":"","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"20ml","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2023-09-24T20:37:33+03:00","